  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aja nke ụbọchị niile",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwara Mosis okwu sị ya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Nye ndị Izrel iwu a sị ha, 'Lezienụ anya hụ na unu na-eche nʼihu m, nʼoge niile a kara aka, nri ahụ a na-enye maka onyinye m a na-enye site nʼọkụ, nke isisi ya na-adị m ezi mma.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sị ha, 'Nke a bụ onyinye unu na-enye site nʼọkụ nke unu na-eche nʼihu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": ụmụ atụrụ abụọ gbara otu afọ, nke na-enweghị ntụpọ, ka e jiri ha chụọ aja nsure ọkụ kwa ụbọchị niile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chụọ otu nwa atụrụ nʼoge ụtụtụ, chụọkwa nke ọzọ nʼoge uhuruchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ị ga-ejikwa lita ụtụ ọka abụọ a kwọziri akwọzi nke a gwọkọtara nʼotu lita mmanụ oliv asụrụ asụ, chụọ aja mkpụrụ ọka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nke a bụ aja nsure ọkụ ahụ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyere iwu ya nʼugwu Saịnaị na a ga na-achụrụ ya mgbe niile, dịka aja isisi ya dị ezi mma, aja nke a chụrụ site nʼọkụ nye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmanya ga-eso aja a ga-abụ otu lita mmanya gbara ụka nʼisi otu atụrụ ọbụla, ị ga-awụsa aja ihe ọṅụṅụ a nʼebe nsọ nye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼoge anyasị, ị ga-ewerekwa nwa atụrụ nke abụọ, ya na otu ụdị aja mkpụrụ ọka na aja ihe ọṅụṅụ dị ka i mere nʼụtụtụ, jiri chụọ aja. Nke a bụkwa aja e sitere nʼọkụ chụọ, nke isisi ya dị ezi mma nye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aja nke ụbọchị izuike",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Nʼụbọchị izuike, jiri ụmụ atụrụ abụọ gbara otu afọ, otu afọ, ndị na-enweghị ntụpọ, ha na aja ihe ọṅụṅụ na aja mkpụrụ ọka e ji lita ụtụ ọka anọ na ọkara a kwọziri akwọzi, nke a gwaziri mmanụ mee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nke a bụ aja nsure ọkụ nke Ụbọchị Izuike, tinyere aja nsure ọkụ na aja ihe ọṅụṅụ ndị ahụ a na-achụ nʼoge ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aja nke ụbọchị mbụ nʼọnwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Ọzọ, nʼụbọchị mbụ nke ọnwa ọbụla, a ga-achụrụ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aja nsure ọkụ dị iche, nke a ga-eji ụmụ oke ehi abụọ, na otu ebule, na ụmụ ebule asaa gbara otu afọ, otu afọ, ndị na-enweghị ntụpọ chụọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinyere oke ehi ọbụla, ị ga-eji lita ụtụ ọka isii na ọkara a kwọziri nke ọma, nke a gwara mmanụ chụọ aja. Ma lita ụtụ ọka anọ na ọkara a kwọziri nke ọma, nke a gwakọtakwara mmanụ ka a ga-eji chụọ aja mkpụrụ ọka maka otu ebule ọbụla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma nʼisi otu nwa atụrụ ọbụla, ọ bụ lita ụtụ ọka abụọ a kwọziri nke ọma, nke a gwakọtara ya na mmanụ ka a ga-eji chụọ aja mkpụrụ ọka. A ga-eji ha chụọ aja nsure ọkụ nke isisi ya ga-atọkwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ezi ụtọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aja ọbụla a chụrụ ga-enwe aja ihe ọṅụṅụ nke ga-eso ya, lita mmanya abụọ maka otu oke ehi, ihe ji ntakịrị karịa otu lita mmanya nʼisi otu ebule, na otu lita nʼisi otu nwa atụrụ. Nke a ga-abụ aja nsure ọkụ nke a ga-achụ nʼoge ọnwa ọhụrụ ọ bụla, nʼime afọ ọbụla,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nʼagbanyeghị aja nsure ọkụ na aja ihe ọṅụṅụ nke a na-achụ dịka mgbe ha si dị, a ga-eche otu mkpi nʼihu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dịka aja mmehie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mmemme Ngabiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Nʼụbọchị nke iri na anọ nke ọnwa mbụ, ka a ga-edebe Mmemme Ngabiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼụbọchị na-eso ya, bụ abalị iri na ise nke ọnwa ahụ ka a ga-eme mmemme. Nʼime abalị asaa ka a ga-eri achịcha a na-ejighị ihe na-eko achịcha mee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼụbọchị mbụ mmemme a bidoro, a ga-akpọ nzukọ dị nsọ nke ndị Izrel niile. Ọ dịghị ọrụ siri ike a ga-arụ nʼụbọchị ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unu ga-eji ụmụ oke ehi abụọ, na otu ebule, na ụmụ ebule asaa gbara naanị otu afọ, otu afọ, nke na-enweghị ntụpọ ọbụla chụọrọ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aja nsure ọkụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼisi otu oke ehi ọbụla, a ga-achụ aja mkpụrụ ọka nke a ga-eji lita ụtụ ọka isii na ọkara a kwọziri nke ọma, a gwakọtara ya na mmanụ chụọ. Nʼisi ebule ọbụla, lita ụtụ ọka anọ na ọkara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma nʼisi otu nwa atụrụ ọbụla, a ga-enye lita ụtụ ọka abụọ a kwọziri nke ọma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinye otu mkpi nʼihi ịchụ aja mmehie maka ikpuchiri unu mmehie unu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ga-achụ aja ndị a, tinyere aja ndị ọzọ niile a na-achụ nʼụbọchị niile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ga-achụ aja ndị a ụbọchị niile nʼime ụbọchị asaa nke mmemme ahụ. Ha ga-abụ aja nke isisi ha dị",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ezi ụtọ. A ga-achụ ha, chụkwaa aja nsure ọkụ na aja ihe ọṅụṅụ nke a na-achụ dịka mgbe ha si dị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼụbọchị nke asaa nweenụ mkpọkọta dị nsọ, unu arụkwala ọrụ nke ụbọchị ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mmemme Izu Asaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Nʼụbọchị mbụ nke mkpụrụ mbụ, mgbe unu na-eche onyinye ọka ọhụrụ unu nʼihu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nʼoge mmemme Izu Asaa, nweenụ mkpọkọta dị nsọ. Unu arụkwala ọrụ nke ụbọchị ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unu ga-achụ aja nsure ọkụ, nke isisi ya dị ezi mma nye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.28.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.28.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Ọ bụ ụmụ oke ehi abụọ, na otu ebule, na ụmụ ebule asaa gbara otu afọ, otu afọ, ka a ga-eji chụọ aja a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe unu ga-etinye nʼihe ndị a bụ aja mkpụrụ ọka a ga-eji lita ụtụ ọka isii na ọkara a kwọziri akwọzi, nke a gwakọtara ya na mmanụ chụọ, nʼisi otu oke ehi. Lita ụtụ ọka anọ na ọkara, nʼisi otu ebule,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na lita ụtụ ọka abụọ, nʼisi otu nwa atụrụ ọbụla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọzọkwa, a ga-eji otu mkpi chụọ aja maka mkpuchi mmehie unu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dozie aja ndị a tinyere aja ihe ọṅụṅụ ha, ya na aja nsure ọkụ na aja mkpụrụ ọka ya na aja ahụ so. Hụkwanụ na anụ ụlọ e ji chụọ aja ndị a bụ ndị na-enweghị ntụpọ ọbụla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
